---
import DetailLayout from "../layouts/DetailLayout.astro";
import { approvedCopy } from "../content/site";
---

<DetailLayout
  title="Technology, questions, and lived context."
  eyebrow="Founder"
  intro="Meridian Station was founded by Norman Dumont after decades in software and a personal intersection of Parkinson's, cycling, and technology experimentation."
>
  <section>
    <h2>A practical technology perspective</h2>
    <p>
      An early software-career experience at Rebar Foundry, a dot-com-era
      incubator exploring new technologies, helped shape the founder's interest
      in turning emerging ideas into practical experiments.
    </p>
    <p>
      After decades building software, Parkinson's and cycling brought new
      questions into that work. Ride for Parkinson's began as an awareness
      effort and became a catalyst for real-world technology experimentation.
    </p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/project-story/"
      >Read the project story <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
    >
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Publication responsibility</h2>
    <p>{approvedCopy.publicationResponsibility}</p>
    <p>{approvedCopy.materialRelationships}</p>
    <p>
      Corrections, questions, and project-focused inquiries are welcome.
      <a href="/about/#collaborate"
        >Contact us about a correction or collaboration.</a
      >
    </p>
  </section>
</DetailLayout>
